<title>FRANCE: Dassault opens 7.56 pct lower.</title>
<headline>Dassault opens 7.56 pct lower.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dassault Aviation opened 7.56 percent lower at 1,137 francs on Tuesday after having been suspended since Friday's closing due to a volatile indicated price level.</p>
<p>But immediately after the delayed 0930 GMT opening, the share was suspended limit-up with a new upper limit of 1,165 francs and a lower limit of 1,109. It will requote at midday.</p>
</text>
